WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.330
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:02.600 --> 00:06.000
National Radio and Television Administration.

3
00:30.120 --> 00:32.280
Mr. Zhao, I've left Honghu.

4
00:33.120 --> 00:34.120
You know, before Dingfei,

5
00:34.120 --> 00:35.640
wasn't I always in charge?

6
00:35.840 --> 00:37.160
Would you consider

7
00:37.160 --> 00:39.290
working with me personally this year?

8
00:39.360 --> 00:41.200
Come visit my law firm first.

9
00:41.800 --> 00:42.400
Xiao Li,

10
00:42.400 --> 00:43.280
that SUV of mine

11
00:43.280 --> 00:44.480
hasn't been sold yet.

12
00:45.200 --> 00:46.930
Then lower the price a bit more.

13
00:47.320 --> 00:48.780
I need the money urgently.

14
00:49.360 --> 00:50.680
Mr. Zhang, you mentioned before

15
00:50.680 --> 00:52.480
that you needed a new corporate counsel.

16
00:52.480 --> 00:54.340
Let's chat when you have a chance.

17
00:54.360 --> 00:57.690
Yes, on the second floor of that bathhouse on Lawyer Street.

18
00:58.360 --> 00:59.090
Sister Pang,

19
00:59.280 --> 01:00.440
I parked the car at the door for you.

20
01:00.440 --> 01:00.880
Okay.

21
01:00.960 --> 01:01.440
Keys.

22
01:01.760 --> 01:02.120
Okay.

23
01:23.320 --> 01:26.080
The second floor of this bathhouse has changed hands.

24
01:26.080 --> 01:27.800
Xiao Longnv,

25
01:28.640 --> 01:30.500
did she run out of an ancient tomb?

26
01:30.560 --> 01:32.479
She legitimately came from Honghu.

27
01:32.479 --> 01:33.960
Aren't they all elites in Honghu?

28
01:33.960 --> 01:35.759
What is she doing in this corner?

29
01:36.039 --> 01:36.960
Sister Long.

30
01:37.600 --> 01:38.600
First-hand news.

31
01:38.880 --> 01:39.840
When we came to look at the place,

32
01:39.840 --> 01:40.920
wasn't the law firm diagonally across

33
01:40.920 --> 01:42.280
about to close down?

34
01:42.560 --> 01:44.200
They took a big case a couple of days ago

35
01:44.200 --> 01:45.640
and are completely revived.

36
01:45.640 --> 01:46.280
Really?

37
01:47.000 --> 01:47.560
If you ask me,

38
01:47.560 --> 01:48.680
the feng shui of our Lawyer Street

39
01:48.680 --> 01:50.640
is quite good.

40
01:50.680 --> 01:51.920
Except for the bathhouse downstairs,

41
01:51.920 --> 01:52.920
which is damp and noisy.

42
01:52.920 --> 01:53.479
Brother,

43
01:53.680 --> 01:54.840
I'll get you some vinegar.

44
01:54.840 --> 01:56.240
Let's do a vinegar scrub.

45
01:57.720 --> 01:58.280
Miaomiao,

46
01:58.280 --> 01:59.360
don't blame me for saying this,

47
01:59.360 --> 02:00.820
but you still need to grow.

48
02:01.360 --> 02:02.120
Your vision,

49
02:02.120 --> 02:03.640
you need to look further ahead.

50
02:03.640 --> 02:04.480
Just look over here.

51
02:04.480 --> 02:04.920
Come,

52
02:05.400 --> 02:06.260
look over here.

53
02:07.000 --> 02:09.120
Do you know what this beautiful scene

54
02:09.320 --> 02:10.240
is called?

55
02:11.160 --> 02:11.760
What?

56
02:13.200 --> 02:14.200
This is called

57
02:14.400 --> 02:15.880
Rising Justice.

58
02:16.120 --> 02:16.680
Right?

59
02:17.200 --> 02:18.480
Once we open the window,

60
02:18.480 --> 02:20.480
the feng shui flows in.

61
02:20.480 --> 02:22.480
Cases will keep coming in,

62
02:22.480 --> 02:24.200
and business will boom.

63
02:41.000 --> 02:41.640
Come in.

64
02:43.320 --> 02:43.920
Director.

65
02:44.600 --> 02:45.160
Lawyer Shen.

66
02:45.160 --> 02:45.600
Here you go.

67
02:45.600 --> 02:46.160
Come on.

68
02:48.840 --> 02:50.160
Mr. Zhao from Dingfei

69
02:50.160 --> 02:51.600
called me this morning

70
02:51.800 --> 02:52.440
and said

71
02:52.840 --> 02:53.920
he would renew the contract with us.

72
02:53.920 --> 02:55.600
I know Mr. Zhao well.

73
02:56.000 --> 02:58.060
We've had a couple of meals together.

74
02:58.120 --> 03:00.160
Lawyer Li was just promoted to senior partner,

75
03:00.160 --> 03:01.400
so he's too busy.

76
03:03.120 --> 03:04.160
He can manage.

77
03:04.760 --> 03:05.640
I remember

78
03:05.760 --> 03:08.160
Xiao Longnv used to be in charge of Dingfei.

79
03:08.520 --> 03:10.380
It might be inconvenient for you.

80
03:11.840 --> 03:13.440
It's very convenient for me.

81
03:15.160 --> 03:17.040
I really admire Lawyer Li's vision.

82
03:17.040 --> 03:19.360
Willing to sacrifice, knowing when to let go,

83
03:19.360 --> 03:20.840
and not clinging to old ties.

84
03:20.840 --> 03:21.440
By the way,

85
03:21.440 --> 03:22.480
I heard

86
03:22.720 --> 03:23.840
that Xiao Longnv started

87
03:23.840 --> 03:25.160
her own law firm.

88
03:27.440 --> 03:28.040
Is that so?

89
03:32.120 --> 03:32.600
Sister,

90
03:32.600 --> 03:33.720
will this work?

91
03:33.720 --> 03:34.840
What do you mean?

92
03:34.840 --> 03:36.440
Of course it will.

93
03:37.600 --> 03:38.920
Have you ever heard the saying,

94
03:38.920 --> 03:40.520
"bottom out and bounce back"?

95
03:40.520 --> 03:42.600
We are bouncing back right now.

96
03:42.600 --> 03:43.320
Understand?

97
03:43.320 --> 03:43.960
Understood.

98
03:43.960 --> 03:45.240
What we have now

99
03:45.560 --> 03:47.680
is a standard comeback script.

100
03:47.720 --> 03:48.450
Understood.

101
03:48.600 --> 03:49.160
Miao'er.

102
03:49.880 --> 03:51.120
Are you ready to play?

103
03:51.520 --> 03:52.280
Start playing.

104
03:52.280 --> 03:52.720
Play.

105
03:53.120 --> 03:53.400
Hello.

106
03:53.400 --> 03:55.079
You can consult me if you have any legal questions.

107
03:55.079 --> 03:56.320
Xiao Longnv Law Firm.

108
03:56.320 --> 03:57.840
But Xiao Longnv

109
03:57.840 --> 03:59.120
has always been quite unique.

110
03:59.120 --> 04:01.780
So many lawyers are dying to get into our Honghu.

111
04:01.840 --> 04:02.880
But look at her.

112
04:03.720 --> 04:04.600
Honghu used to

113
04:04.720 --> 04:06.360
protect her too well.

114
04:06.680 --> 04:07.940
She should suffer a bit

115
04:08.080 --> 04:09.340
and change her temper.

116
04:09.440 --> 04:10.960
She needs to experience

117
04:11.440 --> 04:12.900
the hardships of society.

118
04:13.680 --> 04:14.360
Hello.

119
04:14.360 --> 04:15.760
You can consult me if you have any legal questions.

120
04:15.760 --> 04:16.959
Xiao Longnv Law Firm.

121
04:17.399 --> 04:18.120
Sister Hu.

122
04:18.120 --> 04:19.720
That matter from last time is easy to settle. Come, come.

123
04:19.720 --> 04:21.320
Come in and chat. Come, come.

124
04:21.320 --> 04:22.040
Lawyer Xiao.

125
04:22.040 --> 04:24.360
The company has decided to renew the contract with Honghu.

126
04:24.360 --> 04:25.040
As you know,

127
04:25.120 --> 04:27.780
Mr. Zhao values brand and reputation very much.

128
04:27.800 --> 04:29.330
He heard that when you left,

129
04:29.360 --> 04:31.960
you had an unpleasant falling out with Honghu.

130
04:34.480 --> 04:35.080
Director.

131
04:35.280 --> 04:36.760
I remember when I first joined,

132
04:36.760 --> 04:37.960
you taught us

133
04:38.200 --> 04:39.280
that a lawyer's sword...

134
04:39.280 --> 04:40.680
You must swing it for the shieldless.

135
04:40.680 --> 04:42.240
Your understanding of law and justice

136
04:42.240 --> 04:43.880
is too superficial.

137
04:44.000 --> 04:45.120
Think carefully

138
04:45.200 --> 04:46.600
about what kind of lawyer

139
04:46.720 --> 04:47.920
you really want to be.

140
04:51.240 --> 04:51.920
It's okay.

141
04:53.800 --> 04:55.240
It's okay.

142
04:57.360 --> 04:58.680
You lost the labor arbitration

143
04:58.680 --> 05:00.680
because of insufficient evidence, understand?

144
05:00.680 --> 05:02.120
I don't even know if you worked there or not.

145
05:02.120 --> 05:03.360
How can I help you?

146
05:03.480 --> 05:04.800
I really worked there.

147
05:04.800 --> 05:05.680
I didn't lie to you.

148
05:05.680 --> 05:06.600
Don't touch me.

149
05:06.640 --> 05:07.400
I'm warning you.

150
05:07.400 --> 05:08.040
If you touch me again,

151
05:08.040 --> 05:08.960
I'll sue you for picking quarrels and provoking trouble.

152
05:08.960 --> 05:11.290
I'll have you arrested, believe it or not?

153
05:11.480 --> 05:13.120
Then please have mercy

154
05:13.440 --> 05:14.640
and refund my money.

155
05:15.320 --> 05:17.520
Then you'll be charged with extortion.

156
05:18.000 --> 05:19.640
That's all the money I have left.

157
05:19.640 --> 05:21.000
Refund my money.

158
05:22.760 --> 05:24.000
You're doing this again, huh?

159
05:24.000 --> 05:24.880
I'm warning you.

160
05:24.880 --> 05:26.400
This has nothing to do with me.

161
05:26.400 --> 05:27.280
You're trying to scam me.

162
05:27.280 --> 05:28.400
I'm acting in self-defense.

163
05:28.400 --> 05:29.960
Bro, you're pretty tough.

164
05:30.040 --> 05:31.720
Did you get your law license from a driving school?

165
05:31.720 --> 05:33.840
Waving your arms around to scare people.

166
05:33.840 --> 05:35.720
Don't be afraid. He's lying to you.

167
05:35.720 --> 05:37.480
Wait, who are you?

168
05:37.720 --> 05:39.159
Does this have anything to do with you?

169
05:39.159 --> 05:40.040
Since I saw it,

170
05:40.040 --> 05:41.960
it has something to do with me.

171
05:41.960 --> 05:42.720
You learned a little law,

172
05:42.720 --> 05:44.280
and you're just throwing accusations around.

173
05:44.280 --> 05:44.960
Fine.

174
05:44.960 --> 05:46.159
I don't have time to waste

175
05:46.159 --> 05:46.800
with you women here.

176
05:46.800 --> 05:49.360
What era is this? Still sexist?

177
05:50.040 --> 05:51.800
What happened? Tell me.

178
05:59.800 --> 06:02.200
I haven't had time to buy a coffee table yet.

179
06:02.920 --> 06:03.760
Have some.

180
06:05.200 --> 06:06.000
Go ahead.

181
06:06.320 --> 06:07.850
They're for guests anyway.

182
06:13.760 --> 06:14.760
It's delicious.

183
06:19.880 --> 06:21.880
I worked at that restaurant

184
06:22.320 --> 06:23.640
for over five months.

185
06:23.880 --> 06:24.810
Waiting tables,

186
06:25.000 --> 06:25.760
serving food,

187
06:25.760 --> 06:26.560
washing dishes,

188
06:26.560 --> 06:28.000
I had to do everything.

189
06:28.000 --> 06:29.860
At first, they gave me 2,000 yuan,

190
06:30.040 --> 06:31.800
but in the end, they didn't pay me anything

191
06:31.800 --> 06:33.460
and said I didn't do anything.

192
06:33.520 --> 06:35.580
Did you sign an employment contract?

193
06:35.640 --> 06:36.440
Nothing at all.

194
06:36.440 --> 06:37.640
Do you have any clock-in records

195
06:37.640 --> 06:39.000
or attendance records?

196
06:39.760 --> 06:40.640
None of those?

197
06:44.880 --> 06:45.880
Then, um,

198
06:46.640 --> 06:48.560
how much are the legal fees?

199
06:49.640 --> 06:51.520
The money I finally managed to save

200
06:51.520 --> 06:53.880
was all taken by that lawyer.

201
06:54.200 --> 06:55.320
You don't need to worry about that.

202
06:55.320 --> 06:56.780
We can apply for legal aid.

203
06:58.960 --> 07:00.080
It means

204
07:00.080 --> 07:01.640
you don't have to pay the legal fees.

205
07:01.640 --> 07:03.840
The legal aid center will subsidize me.

206
07:04.080 --> 07:06.120
When you go back, find the neighborhood committee

207
07:06.120 --> 07:08.780
and get a certificate of financial difficulty.

208
07:12.800 --> 07:13.960
Thank you, Ms. Lawyer.

209
07:13.960 --> 07:14.560
Thank you, Ms. Lawyer.

210
07:14.560 --> 07:16.020
You're like a sister to me.

211
07:19.400 --> 07:19.720
Okay, okay.

212
07:19.720 --> 07:21.380
I'll get it for you right away.

213
07:22.440 --> 07:23.200
Ladies.

214
07:23.440 --> 07:24.080
What would you like to eat?

215
07:24.080 --> 07:24.680
Where is Wu Lian?

216
07:24.680 --> 07:25.810
Tell her to come out.

217
07:26.720 --> 07:27.480
Who?

218
07:27.720 --> 07:28.840
We don't have anyone by that name here.

219
07:28.840 --> 07:30.520
Wu Lian owes my sister money.

220
07:30.520 --> 07:31.760
I must see her today

221
07:31.760 --> 07:32.360
and make her pay it back.

222
07:32.360 --> 07:33.600
Did you make a mistake?

223
07:33.600 --> 07:34.440
There really is no such person.

224
07:34.440 --> 07:36.159
She sent my sister photos of your shop.

225
07:36.159 --> 07:37.080
How could I be mistaken?

226
07:37.080 --> 07:38.010
Here, the photo.

227
07:38.320 --> 07:39.180
I remember her.

228
07:39.520 --> 07:40.440
Wu Lian, right?

229
07:40.600 --> 07:42.440
She came to me looking for a job around the New Year.

230
07:42.440 --> 07:44.080
I thought I'd let her give it a try.

231
07:44.080 --> 07:45.040
But as soon as she started,

232
07:45.040 --> 07:46.400
she broke several plates.

233
07:46.400 --> 07:47.600
I kicked her out that very day.

234
07:47.600 --> 07:48.520
Kicked her out?

235
07:48.640 --> 07:49.360
Stop acting.

236
07:49.360 --> 07:51.490
She was still working here last month.

237
07:52.480 --> 07:53.240
Little girl,

238
07:53.240 --> 07:54.500
society is dangerous.

239
07:54.720 --> 07:56.040
You need to be more careful.

240
07:56.040 --> 07:57.360
Don't call me sister.

241
07:57.360 --> 07:58.000
I'm not your sister.

242
07:58.000 --> 07:59.080
Are you hiding in the kitchen,

243
07:59.080 --> 07:59.600
Wu Lian?

244
08:00.160 --> 08:01.160
You are Wu Lian, right?

245
08:01.160 --> 08:02.160
You've got the wrong person.

246
08:02.160 --> 08:03.160
I'm not Sister Lian.

247
08:03.160 --> 08:04.760
Hurry up and wipe the tables.

248
08:05.680 --> 08:06.240
Miss,

249
08:06.400 --> 08:07.640
I didn't lie to you, did I?

250
08:07.640 --> 08:09.840
I told you there's no one named Wu Lian here,

251
08:09.840 --> 08:11.300
but you didn't believe me.

252
08:11.320 --> 08:12.480
I'm sorry, boss.

253
08:12.840 --> 08:13.440
I'm sorry.

254
08:13.960 --> 08:14.840
Look at you.

255
08:14.920 --> 08:16.650
Look at what you did to the shop.

256
08:16.720 --> 08:18.320
You should have asked first.

257
08:18.760 --> 08:20.040
I did it all? You didn't do anything?

258
08:20.040 --> 08:21.400
I'm sorry, sir.

259
08:21.560 --> 08:23.400
May your business prosper, boss.

260
08:23.400 --> 08:24.000
Let's go.

261
08:28.400 --> 08:31.080
It seems the boss has definitely silenced the employees.

262
08:31.080 --> 08:32.280
Even with witnesses,

263
08:32.679 --> 08:34.480
we still need sufficient objective evidence

264
08:34.480 --> 08:35.440
to be more certain.

265
08:35.440 --> 08:37.039
But Sister Lian has nothing.

266
08:37.120 --> 08:38.980
Existence always leaves a trace.

267
08:39.200 --> 08:41.799
There must be something we haven't thought of.

268
08:54.960 --> 08:56.020
Where's the money?

269
08:57.400 --> 08:59.880
I... I found another lawyer.

270
09:00.240 --> 09:02.170
What's the use of finding a lawyer?

271
09:02.240 --> 09:03.320
Didn't I tell you

272
09:03.320 --> 09:05.050
that I need the money urgently?

273
09:06.720 --> 09:11.920
It's an honor to learn from you.

274
09:12.080 --> 09:13.210
It's just a meeting.

275
09:13.360 --> 09:14.920
This is making me nervous.

276
09:17.920 --> 09:18.480
Mr. Li.

277
09:18.840 --> 09:20.760
This is Su Bowen, who just joined our team.

278
09:20.760 --> 09:21.360
Ding Chao.

279
09:21.520 --> 09:22.080
Lawyer Li,

280
09:22.080 --> 09:23.880
it's your honor to learn from me.

281
09:25.640 --> 09:26.960
I... I... I mean,

282
09:26.960 --> 09:27.840
my honor.

283
09:27.960 --> 09:28.560
Lawyer Li,

284
09:29.080 --> 09:30.600
I'm so happy to be chosen by you.

285
09:30.600 --> 09:30.880
Really,

286
09:30.880 --> 09:32.400
I've always thought you're very stylish.

287
09:32.400 --> 09:34.060
You're handsome and capable.

288
09:34.160 --> 09:34.960
As for me,

289
09:35.080 --> 09:36.520
I have a Level 2-B in Mandarin,

290
09:36.520 --> 09:37.520
CET-6 in English,

291
09:37.520 --> 09:38.960
and passed the bar exam by 30 points.

292
09:38.960 --> 09:40.160
Whatever you need,

293
09:40.160 --> 09:41.280
you can count on me.

294
09:43.120 --> 09:44.180
My name is Su Bowen.

295
09:44.320 --> 09:46.120
I... My name is Ding Chao.

296
09:47.120 --> 09:47.780
Have a seat.

297
09:51.960 --> 09:53.040
Have you read the materials?

298
09:53.040 --> 09:53.440
Yes.

299
09:54.240 --> 09:55.680
But there are still some materials from Dingfei Company

300
09:55.680 --> 09:56.640
with Xiao Longnv.

301
09:56.640 --> 09:58.300
She hasn't sent them over yet.

302
09:58.920 --> 10:01.560
I've also finished reading Wangang's materials.

303
10:01.560 --> 10:02.890
Lan Ya, here's the plan.

304
10:03.080 --> 10:04.160
Ding Chao will assist you

305
10:04.160 --> 10:06.360
to go over Wangang's long-term strategic agreement.

306
10:06.360 --> 10:07.000
Give it to me on Friday.

307
10:07.000 --> 10:07.400
Okay.

308
10:07.400 --> 10:08.280
Next Friday, right?

309
10:08.280 --> 10:09.410
We have enough time.

310
10:10.960 --> 10:11.690
This Friday.

311
10:11.920 --> 10:12.720
Any problems?

312
10:14.160 --> 10:14.600
No.

313
10:15.280 --> 10:15.600
No.

314
10:15.800 --> 10:17.330
Isn't today only Thursday?

315
10:17.520 --> 10:18.780
We have plenty of time.

316
10:19.800 --> 10:21.280
All right, let's get to work.

317
10:21.280 --> 10:22.160
Copy that.

318
10:22.880 --> 10:24.080
Take care, Lawyer Li.

319
10:47.760 --> 10:48.840
Hot buns!

320
10:49.440 --> 10:51.640
Buns, soy milk, and fried dough sticks!

321
11:08.120 --> 11:08.840
What's the matter?

322
11:08.840 --> 11:10.080
Do you have to call?

323
11:10.360 --> 11:11.720
You blocked me on WeChat.

324
11:11.720 --> 11:13.000
I could only call you.

325
11:13.480 --> 11:15.280
I need to sync with you about Dingfei.

326
11:15.280 --> 11:16.560
You took over Dingfei?

327
11:17.080 --> 11:18.200
You helped them standardize

328
11:18.200 --> 11:19.640
the layoff process before, right?

329
11:19.640 --> 11:20.440
I need the whole process.

330
11:20.440 --> 11:22.000
Send an email for whatever materials you need.

331
11:22.000 --> 11:23.240
I'll reply within seven working days.

332
11:23.240 --> 11:24.720
Seven working days?

333
11:38.960 --> 11:40.160
What the hell is this?

334
11:41.360 --> 11:42.320
What do you mean?

335
11:42.720 --> 11:44.000
Wait, who are you?

336
11:44.440 --> 11:45.520
I'm Dong Beihu.

337
11:45.840 --> 11:47.160
And I'm the Northwest Wolf.

338
11:47.160 --> 11:47.960
Who let you in?

339
11:47.960 --> 11:48.960
How did you get in?

340
11:49.240 --> 11:50.480
I just walked in normally.

341
11:50.480 --> 11:51.720
I opened the door with a key.

342
11:51.720 --> 11:53.380
I went drinking last night...

343
11:53.520 --> 11:55.080
Do I need to explain to you?

344
11:55.200 --> 11:56.440
This is my home, my company.

345
11:56.440 --> 11:57.920
How did I get in? This...

346
12:00.800 --> 12:01.730
Where's my sign?

347
12:01.800 --> 12:02.600
I took it down.

348
12:03.800 --> 12:04.440
Where's my big tiger?

349
12:04.440 --> 12:05.400
Where are my decorations?

350
12:05.400 --> 12:06.360
I moved them.

351
12:06.680 --> 12:07.480
Who are you?

352
12:07.680 --> 12:08.920
I'm the tenant here.

353
12:10.520 --> 12:12.250
My mom rented this floor to you.

354
12:12.560 --> 12:13.720
Sister Pang is your mom?

355
12:13.720 --> 12:14.600
Who are you trying to take advantage of?

356
12:14.600 --> 12:15.680
I call her mom and you call her sister?

357
12:15.680 --> 12:16.440
How old are you?

358
12:16.440 --> 12:18.160
Do I need to take advantage of you?

359
12:18.160 --> 12:19.080
You're ridiculous.

360
12:19.080 --> 12:20.200
Dressed like a hooligan this morning,

361
12:20.200 --> 12:20.800
shirtless,

362
12:20.800 --> 12:21.800
wandering around here.

363
12:21.800 --> 12:22.920
What do you mean, like a hooligan?

364
12:22.920 --> 12:24.400
I was just feeling hot, okay?

365
12:24.400 --> 12:25.280
This is my house.

366
12:25.280 --> 12:26.400
I can wear whatever I want.

367
12:26.400 --> 12:27.320
This is my company.

368
12:27.320 --> 12:28.400
If I'm hot, I can even be naked.

369
12:28.400 --> 12:29.400
If you're hot, take it off. Take it off.

370
12:29.400 --> 12:30.080
Let me tell you.

371
12:30.080 --> 12:31.400
It's normal for me to wear anything in my own house.

372
12:31.400 --> 12:32.160
Don't provoke me.

373
12:32.160 --> 12:33.400
I am provoking you.

374
12:33.400 --> 12:33.960
Take it off.

375
12:33.960 --> 12:34.480
I will.

376
12:34.520 --> 12:35.600
Don't close your eyes. I'm really taking it off.

377
12:35.600 --> 12:36.400
My eyes are wide open.

378
12:36.400 --> 12:37.440
Come on. I'll take it off.

379
12:37.440 --> 12:39.300
You really think I wouldn't dare?

380
12:43.000 --> 12:43.920
Are you busy?

381
12:44.360 --> 12:44.960
I'll leave you to it.

382
12:44.960 --> 12:45.560
Come back.

383
12:46.600 --> 12:47.360
Why are you leaving?

384
12:47.360 --> 12:48.620
What are you thinking?

385
12:48.840 --> 12:51.000
What are you doing so early in the morning?

386
12:51.000 --> 12:51.840
What do you mean, what am I doing?

387
12:51.840 --> 12:52.320
Who are you?

388
12:52.320 --> 12:53.580
Who are you yelling at?

389
12:53.640 --> 12:54.360
Let me tell you.

390
12:54.360 --> 12:56.160
I didn't agree to rent the house.

391
12:56.600 --> 12:57.720
Do I need your permission?

392
12:57.720 --> 12:59.360
You're really ridiculous.

393
13:01.920 --> 13:02.440
Shoes.

394
13:02.440 --> 13:03.720
I know they are shoes.

395
13:05.960 --> 13:07.760
I'm telling you, I didn't agree.

396
13:14.440 --> 13:15.040
Sister.

397
13:15.600 --> 13:16.720
I've found out.

398
13:17.120 --> 13:17.960
This Dong Beihu

399
13:17.960 --> 13:19.090
previously opened a

400
13:19.120 --> 13:20.720
legal consulting firm here.

401
13:21.440 --> 13:23.360
He... he knows the law?

402
13:23.360 --> 13:24.440
What law?

403
13:24.440 --> 13:26.840
He's just a middleman hustling for business.

404
13:26.840 --> 13:28.720
A while ago, he beat up a lawyer

405
13:28.720 --> 13:29.480
and went straight to the detention center.

406
13:29.480 --> 13:30.720
He was just released yesterday.

407
13:30.720 --> 13:32.200
He doesn't look like a good guy to me.

408
13:32.200 --> 13:34.360
He's wearing shorts early in the morning.

409
13:34.360 --> 13:35.290
Just ignore him.

410
13:35.360 --> 13:36.760
Good news! Good news!

411
13:37.040 --> 13:38.600
Good news! Good news!

412
13:38.640 --> 13:39.480
Pangjie Bathhouse.

413
13:39.480 --> 13:43.080
Get a free bath scrub with legal consultation!

414
13:43.240 --> 13:44.600
Free bath scrub!

415
13:46.000 --> 13:47.720
Sister, look at that guy.

416
13:47.840 --> 13:49.200
Isn't he stealing our business?

417
13:49.200 --> 13:51.720
Get a free bath scrub with legal consultation!

418
13:51.720 --> 13:52.400
Power off.

419
13:54.200 --> 13:54.320
Cizi is out.

420
13:54.320 --> 13:55.440
Huzi, you're out.

421
13:55.600 --> 13:57.800
Yeah, letting the tiger return to the mountain.

422
13:57.800 --> 13:58.960
What do you mean "out"?

423
13:58.960 --> 14:00.920
That was a total misunderstanding, you know?

424
14:00.920 --> 14:01.920
Don't talk nonsense.

425
14:01.920 --> 14:02.800
Okay, okay.

426
14:04.720 --> 14:05.400
Young man.

427
14:05.800 --> 14:06.920
Is the law firm

428
14:06.920 --> 14:08.160
upstairs?

429
14:09.280 --> 14:10.520
Ma'am, whatever you want to consult,

430
14:10.520 --> 14:11.720
just do it right here.

431
14:11.720 --> 14:13.040
My consultation comes with a free bath scrub.

432
14:13.040 --> 14:14.300
No need to go upstairs.

433
14:14.480 --> 14:15.600
Really a free bath scrub?

434
14:15.600 --> 14:16.440
Really. Go on,

435
14:16.440 --> 14:17.160
get in line.

436
14:17.400 --> 14:18.400
Okay, okay, okay.

437
14:19.160 --> 14:20.200
Such a good deal.

438
14:20.320 --> 14:20.980
Brother Hu.

439
14:21.360 --> 14:23.560
So this is your "free bath scrub with consultation"?

440
14:23.560 --> 14:25.720
What? Do you have a problem with it?

441
14:25.840 --> 14:28.040
I don't have a problem. How would I dare?

442
14:28.160 --> 14:30.440
I just don't know if Sister Pang has a problem with it.

443
14:30.440 --> 14:31.680
What problem could she have?

444
14:31.680 --> 14:32.160
Sister Pang!

445
14:32.160 --> 14:33.220
What are you doing?

446
14:33.560 --> 14:35.640
You little brat, what are you doing now?

447
14:35.640 --> 14:37.120
Can't you behave right after coming back?

448
14:37.120 --> 14:38.000
No, I'm offering

449
14:38.000 --> 14:39.360
a free consultation with a bath scrub.

450
14:39.360 --> 14:40.240
Drumming up business for us.

451
14:40.240 --> 14:40.600
Look.

452
14:40.600 --> 14:41.400
Look.

453
14:42.320 --> 14:43.320
Hurry up and put that broken sign away.

454
14:43.320 --> 14:43.960
Okay, okay, okay.

455
14:43.960 --> 14:45.280
You just need to be taught a lesson.

456
14:45.280 --> 14:46.040
Alright.

457
14:49.040 --> 14:50.440
Are you an elementary schooler?

458
14:50.440 --> 14:52.240
Getting a parent when you argue.

459
14:52.640 --> 14:53.120
Right.

460
14:57.600 --> 14:59.040
What the hell is this?

461
15:00.920 --> 15:02.080
I'll think about it, Lawyer Xiao.

462
15:02.080 --> 15:03.520
Okay, contact me anytime.

463
15:03.520 --> 15:04.040
Okay.

464
15:04.160 --> 15:04.920
Take care.

465
15:04.960 --> 15:06.020
Alright, alright.

466
15:07.560 --> 15:08.400
Sister Long, Sister Long.

467
15:08.400 --> 15:10.320
Look, is this Sister Lian?

468
15:11.480 --> 15:12.400
Look, everyone.

469
15:12.400 --> 15:13.560
We didn't touch her.

470
15:13.600 --> 15:15.120
She bumped into us herself.

471
15:15.120 --> 15:16.160
And now she's refusing to get up.

472
15:16.160 --> 15:17.400
He owes me money.

473
15:17.400 --> 15:18.680
I don't owe her any money.

474
15:18.680 --> 15:19.560
Don't listen to her nonsense.

475
15:19.560 --> 15:20.640
What's going on?

476
15:20.640 --> 15:22.280
Didn't we file a case for her?

477
15:22.640 --> 15:25.100
Why did she go make a scene at the restaurant?

478
15:36.240 --> 15:37.760
What did the boss say?

479
15:39.760 --> 15:40.820
The boss won't pay.

480
15:41.440 --> 15:43.280
Then I'll have to wait forever.

481
15:44.720 --> 15:46.480
Do you want me dead?

482
15:48.560 --> 15:50.080
I'm your father.

483
15:53.480 --> 15:54.800
How did you get this?

484
15:57.160 --> 15:59.560
The boss pushed me, and I lost my balance.

485
15:59.920 --> 16:01.680
I hit the corner of the table.

486
16:05.880 --> 16:06.600
Daughter,

487
16:06.800 --> 16:08.680
isn't this our chance?

488
16:49.720 --> 16:50.360
Useless.

489
16:50.520 --> 16:51.520
You only got 200 yuan.

490
16:51.520 --> 16:52.850
What is that enough for?

491
16:55.480 --> 16:57.600
There's an old saying in China: a son pays his father's debts.

492
16:57.600 --> 16:58.360
You know?

493
16:58.360 --> 16:59.360
Even if I die,

494
16:59.360 --> 17:02.220
they won't let you off and will keep looking for you.

495
17:07.000 --> 17:07.480
Right.

496
17:09.000 --> 17:11.119
Didn't you find a little lawyer?

497
17:11.119 --> 17:13.050
Ask her to give you the money first.

498
17:14.200 --> 17:15.119
Just make up a lie.

499
17:15.119 --> 17:16.599
Say you need money for medical treatment urgently.

500
17:16.599 --> 17:18.720
Just ask her to lend you some money first.

501
17:18.720 --> 17:19.250
Let's go.

502
17:19.599 --> 17:21.000
I'm not going. I'm not going.

503
17:21.000 --> 17:22.440
I'm not going. I'm not going.

504
17:22.440 --> 17:24.099
Are you rebelling against me?

505
17:28.160 --> 17:28.800
Come with me.

506
17:28.800 --> 17:29.320
My cup.

507
17:29.680 --> 17:31.040
Get out of my way.

508
17:31.800 --> 17:33.130
Try touching her again.

509
17:33.160 --> 17:33.920
Who are you?

510
17:34.040 --> 17:35.320
None of your business.

511
17:35.640 --> 17:36.440
Are you okay?

512
17:36.440 --> 17:37.320
Ms. Lawyer,

513
17:37.320 --> 17:38.050
are you okay?

514
17:39.520 --> 17:41.760
You're that little lawyer, right?

515
17:42.040 --> 17:42.920
I'm here,

516
17:43.400 --> 17:44.560
teaching my daughter a lesson.

517
17:44.560 --> 17:45.280
Is it any of your business?

518
17:45.280 --> 17:46.280
It is my business.

519
17:46.280 --> 17:47.760
It's still illegal for a father to beat his daughter.

520
17:47.760 --> 17:48.440
Did you know that?

521
17:48.440 --> 17:50.040
Don't talk nonsense with me here.

522
17:50.040 --> 17:51.440
Believe it or not, if you piss me off,

523
17:51.440 --> 17:52.520
I'll slap you too.

524
17:52.520 --> 17:53.280
Slap me and see.

525
17:53.280 --> 17:54.520
I'll call the police immediately,

526
17:54.520 --> 17:56.280
and sue you for picking quarrels and provoking trouble, and intentional injury.

527
17:56.280 --> 17:57.320
Are you going to slap me or not?

528
17:57.320 --> 17:58.250
Come on, slap me.

529
17:58.440 --> 17:59.040
Slap me!

530
17:59.680 --> 18:00.640
You're out of line.

531
18:00.640 --> 18:01.170
Let's go.

532
18:01.800 --> 18:02.800
Get out of the way.

533
18:12.280 --> 18:12.760
Come on.

534
18:13.040 --> 18:14.480
Thank you, Miss Lawyer.

535
18:16.000 --> 18:17.060
Does it still hurt?

536
18:18.240 --> 18:19.160
Not anymore.

537
18:19.400 --> 18:20.520
Tell me the truth.

538
18:21.520 --> 18:22.450
These injuries,

539
18:22.880 --> 18:24.080
did your dad do this?

540
18:25.880 --> 18:27.520
He's a gambling addict

541
18:27.760 --> 18:29.280
and owes a lot of money.

542
18:29.840 --> 18:31.040
He took

543
18:31.320 --> 18:32.320
all my money.

544
18:33.000 --> 18:34.440
If I don't have money for him,

545
18:34.440 --> 18:36.880
he makes me stage accidents.

546
18:37.320 --> 18:39.760
Eating glass shards hurts so much.

547
18:48.920 --> 18:49.480
Then,

548
18:50.000 --> 18:52.060
why didn't you think of running away?

549
18:52.240 --> 18:53.280
I can't run.

550
18:53.280 --> 18:55.240
If I run, I'll become a fugitive.

551
18:55.440 --> 18:56.200
What fugitive?

552
18:56.200 --> 18:57.460
What law did you break?

553
18:57.760 --> 18:59.760
I have to pay back the money for him.

554
19:00.280 --> 19:02.040
A son must pay his father's debts.

555
19:02.040 --> 19:05.170
Who told you that a son paying his father's debts is a law?

556
19:05.760 --> 19:06.960
He did.

557
19:07.480 --> 19:08.520
He's lying to you.

558
19:08.880 --> 19:10.280
Unless he dies,

559
19:10.280 --> 19:11.760
you inherit his estate,

560
19:12.760 --> 19:15.280
and then use it to pay his debts.

561
19:16.360 --> 19:17.280
R-Really?

562
19:17.440 --> 19:18.570
Of course it's true.

563
19:18.840 --> 19:21.100
Do you believe what a lawyer like me says,

564
19:21.240 --> 19:22.440
or what he says?

565
19:22.440 --> 19:24.240
I-I believe you.

566
19:24.520 --> 19:26.520
I don't want to pay his debts for him.

567
19:26.800 --> 19:30.920
I want to go somewhere far, far away.

568
19:32.120 --> 19:34.000
So he can never find me.

569
19:35.200 --> 19:35.920
I'll save up

570
19:36.400 --> 19:38.760
all the money I earn from working.

571
19:39.680 --> 19:41.240
I'll rent a small place.

572
19:42.120 --> 19:43.960
I'll have hot water for showers.

573
19:44.760 --> 19:45.160
And...

574
19:46.760 --> 19:48.090
I'll have apples to eat.

575
19:50.080 --> 19:50.800
Okay.

576
19:51.680 --> 19:53.160
I'll figure something out for you.

577
19:53.160 --> 19:55.160
Let's find you a place to stay first.

578
19:58.000 --> 19:59.720
No one can stop me. No way.

579
20:00.120 --> 20:00.800
Stop struggling.

580
20:00.800 --> 20:01.760
That bastard Jia Xin.

581
20:01.760 --> 20:02.760
Is he trying to get something for nothing?

582
20:02.760 --> 20:03.760
Son.

583
20:03.760 --> 20:05.400
The money is spent. Just let it go.

584
20:05.400 --> 20:06.920
What do you mean let it go, Mom?

585
20:06.920 --> 20:08.040
Look at our financial situation.

586
20:08.040 --> 20:09.240
It's 200,000!

587
20:09.280 --> 20:10.040
That lawyer's injury

588
20:10.040 --> 20:11.680
wasn't as serious as he claimed.

589
20:11.680 --> 20:13.440
The police would have released me once they figured it out.

590
20:13.440 --> 20:15.320
There was no need to spend so much money for help.

591
20:15.320 --> 20:16.920
Jia Xin just scammed you out of your money.

592
20:16.920 --> 20:18.520
He messed with the wrong guy.

593
20:18.520 --> 20:19.840
I have to destroy him.

594
20:20.000 --> 20:21.000
Enough.

595
20:21.200 --> 20:22.000
Let him go.

596
20:28.160 --> 20:29.880
How can you go barehanded?

597
20:30.560 --> 20:31.000
Here.

598
20:31.040 --> 20:31.880
Take your weapon.

599
20:31.880 --> 20:32.720
Go and fight.

600
20:33.880 --> 20:34.960
You think I wouldn't dare, right?

601
20:34.960 --> 20:35.880
I know you would.

602
20:35.880 --> 20:36.240
Go.

603
20:37.600 --> 20:39.000
See you on the crime show.

604
20:39.560 --> 20:41.090
What are you all looking at?

605
20:41.800 --> 20:43.560
Sister Pang, what's going on?

606
20:45.760 --> 20:46.560
It's my fault.

607
20:48.000 --> 20:49.160
Look, here's what happened.

608
20:49.160 --> 20:50.040
This guy named Dong Beihu

609
20:50.040 --> 20:51.440
accidentally hit someone,

610
20:51.440 --> 20:52.520
so he was sent to the detention center.

611
20:52.520 --> 20:53.680
His mother was very worried,

612
20:53.680 --> 20:54.680
so she found another person.

613
20:54.680 --> 20:55.200
That person said,

614
20:55.200 --> 20:56.000
"Give me 200,000 in cash,

615
20:56.000 --> 20:56.760
and I can pull some strings

616
20:56.760 --> 20:57.680
to get him out on bail."

617
20:57.680 --> 20:58.680
But this guy was actually fine

618
20:58.680 --> 20:59.320
and got released anyway.

619
20:59.320 --> 20:59.880
However, that person

620
20:59.880 --> 21:01.680
still asked his mother for the 200,000 in cash.

621
21:01.680 --> 21:02.240
Isn't this a crime?

622
21:02.240 --> 21:02.760
Isn't it fraud?

623
21:02.760 --> 21:04.220
Shouldn't he be arrested?

624
21:10.120 --> 21:11.800
It's okay. Let's do it again.

625
21:12.080 --> 21:13.600
This person accidentally hit this person.

626
21:13.600 --> 21:15.080
As a result, this person exaggerated the facts

627
21:15.080 --> 21:15.960
and framed this person.

628
21:15.960 --> 21:17.320
This person went to the detention center.

629
21:17.320 --> 21:18.160
Then this person's mother

630
21:18.160 --> 21:18.960
found this other person.

631
21:18.960 --> 21:20.120
This person took advantage of the situation,

632
21:20.120 --> 21:21.480
saying that with 200,000 in cash for operation fees,

633
21:21.480 --> 21:22.960
they could use connections to get bail pending trial.

634
21:22.960 --> 21:24.680
Actually, this person was completely fine.

635
21:24.680 --> 21:26.200
The police figured it out and released them.

636
21:26.200 --> 21:27.920
This person pocketed the 200,000.

637
21:27.920 --> 21:28.960
Tell me, is this a crime?

638
21:28.960 --> 21:29.600
Is it fraud?

639
21:29.600 --> 21:31.120
Shouldn't you arrest him?

640
21:34.040 --> 21:35.440
Do you have any evidence?

641
21:37.440 --> 21:38.200
No.

642
21:40.480 --> 21:42.200
Are you this Jia Xin,

643
21:42.440 --> 21:44.720
coming here to see if you can get away with it?

644
21:44.720 --> 21:45.720
What? I...

645
21:45.720 --> 21:46.680
I'm this guy.

646
21:46.680 --> 21:47.720
I'm the one who got scammed.

647
21:47.720 --> 21:49.280
I'm the main character here.

648
21:49.280 --> 21:50.740
Just a friendly reminder.

649
21:50.800 --> 21:52.680
Concealing the truth and confessing voluntarily

650
21:52.680 --> 21:54.040
are completely different.

651
21:54.040 --> 21:55.000
I...

652
21:55.000 --> 21:56.280
I came here to report a case.

653
21:56.280 --> 21:58.720
Why does it feel like I'm turning myself in?

654
21:59.440 --> 22:00.720
I can't say much more.

655
22:00.720 --> 22:01.720
Watch yourself.

656
22:03.200 --> 22:05.040
What do you mean you can't say?

657
22:08.920 --> 22:10.000
Can I leave now?

658
22:11.200 --> 22:11.920
You can go.

659
22:19.480 --> 22:21.200
Although I don't have evidence,

660
22:21.200 --> 22:22.240
I can swear to it.

661
22:24.680 --> 22:27.760
Sister Long, what should we do about Sister Lian now?

662
22:27.960 --> 22:29.000
Before the trial,

663
22:29.000 --> 22:30.930
we need to deal with Wu Guofu first.

664
22:31.040 --> 22:32.480
A gambler like him

665
22:32.480 --> 22:34.280
won't be able to resist the itch.

666
22:35.480 --> 22:37.720
Can we catch him in the act?

667
22:38.040 --> 22:40.240
But we don't know where he gambles.

668
22:40.680 --> 22:42.400
Get two other people to watch Jia Xin this afternoon.

669
22:42.400 --> 22:43.960
If he shows any signs of breaking the law,

670
22:43.960 --> 22:45.200
report to me immediately.

671
22:45.200 --> 22:46.640
Take photos or videos of everything

672
22:46.640 --> 22:47.720
and send them to the group chat.

673
22:47.720 --> 22:50.000
Why is Dong Beihu so annoying all day?

674
22:50.000 --> 22:51.240
Why is he so loud?

675
22:51.240 --> 22:52.240
Cut the crap.

676
22:52.240 --> 22:55.370
How would I know if you're keeping watch without photos?

677
22:55.720 --> 22:56.240
Alright.

678
22:56.240 --> 22:58.520
I'll treat you when I get my money back.

679
22:59.600 --> 23:00.660
Alright, alright.

680
23:14.040 --> 23:14.700
Brother Hu.

681
23:15.280 --> 23:16.280
Studying?

682
23:16.760 --> 23:18.240
Have you figured out a plan?

683
23:18.240 --> 23:19.520
What's up, heroine?

684
23:19.640 --> 23:21.240
Poking your nose into my business?

685
23:21.240 --> 23:23.120
Can your law firm make money like this?

686
23:23.120 --> 23:24.400
You can't say that.

687
23:24.600 --> 23:26.200
It doesn't matter if I make money.

688
23:26.200 --> 23:28.280
What matters is I thought of a plan for you.

689
23:28.280 --> 23:29.320
I'll tell you for free.

690
23:29.320 --> 23:30.120
For free?

691
23:30.240 --> 23:31.680
Not entirely free.

692
23:31.680 --> 23:32.940
I need a favor from you.

693
23:33.600 --> 23:35.640
You're so tough. What can I do for you?

694
23:35.640 --> 23:37.570
Everyone has their own expertise.

695
23:39.360 --> 23:40.620
Tell me. Let's hear it.

696
23:49.880 --> 23:51.000
If I help you with this,

697
23:51.000 --> 23:52.520
will you really give me advice for free?

698
23:52.520 --> 23:53.480
Yeah.

699
24:04.120 --> 24:04.880
Brother Hu, Brother Hu.

700
24:04.880 --> 24:06.740
The dung beetle is out of its hole.

701
24:07.640 --> 24:09.240
Let's change our target today.

702
24:09.240 --> 24:11.280
Keep an eye on this old man. Same method.

703
24:11.280 --> 24:11.960
Where he goes,

704
24:11.960 --> 24:12.520
what he does,

705
24:12.520 --> 24:15.120
send all the locations and photos to the group.

706
24:38.640 --> 24:39.970
I can't take it anymore.

707
24:40.240 --> 24:42.040
This old geezer can really hold out.

708
24:42.040 --> 24:43.960
I've already missed my nap time.

709
24:44.400 --> 24:45.440
He wouldn't just not go, would he?

710
24:45.440 --> 24:46.440
No way.

711
24:46.440 --> 24:48.200
A guy like him with money

712
24:48.200 --> 24:49.440
definitely can't sit still.

713
24:49.440 --> 24:50.200
Just wait.

714
24:57.960 --> 24:58.760
Got a message.

715
25:03.680 --> 25:04.120
Miao.

716
25:04.680 --> 25:05.680
Split up.

717
25:06.360 --> 25:06.890
Hurry up.

718
25:11.000 --> 25:11.960
Take me with you.

719
25:13.520 --> 25:14.920
Yang is here. Go inside.

720
25:15.040 --> 25:15.560
Okay.

721
25:23.520 --> 25:24.920
I'm not playing anymore.

722
25:31.680 --> 25:32.680
Are you blind?

723
25:35.360 --> 25:36.160
Who are you talking to?

724
25:36.160 --> 25:37.520
I'm talking to you.

725
25:37.520 --> 25:38.520
Do you want to die?

726
25:39.480 --> 25:42.080
I'll put you in a wheelchair, believe it or not.

727
25:44.560 --> 25:45.160
Get lost.

728
25:57.800 --> 25:58.800
I'll add half.

729
25:59.280 --> 26:00.040
Nobody move.

730
26:00.280 --> 26:01.280
Police.

731
26:02.040 --> 26:03.720
Nobody move.

732
26:03.840 --> 26:04.520
Nobody move.

733
26:04.520 --> 26:05.160
You too, squat down.

734
26:05.160 --> 26:05.720
Leniency for those who confess.

735
26:05.720 --> 26:06.240
Squat down.

736
26:06.240 --> 26:07.560
Don't move. Behave yourselves.

737
26:07.560 --> 26:09.220
Nobody move. Squat properly.

738
26:10.040 --> 26:10.960
Squat down. Nobody move.

739
26:10.960 --> 26:11.620
Squat down.

740
26:12.080 --> 26:12.760
It's never too late to turn back.

741
26:12.760 --> 26:13.520
Shut up.

742
26:18.240 --> 26:18.640
Go.

743
26:27.240 --> 26:27.920
Behave.

744
26:30.040 --> 26:31.240
About your business.

745
26:32.120 --> 26:33.720
Why are you pushing so hard?

746
26:33.720 --> 26:34.280
Nonsense.

747
26:34.280 --> 26:36.160
Shouldn't I care about my own business?

748
26:36.160 --> 26:37.280
I've finished helping you.

749
26:37.280 --> 26:38.410
Hurry up and help me.

750
26:40.200 --> 26:41.060
Did you hear me?

751
26:41.240 --> 26:42.000
What?

752
26:42.000 --> 26:43.240
Help me.

753
26:45.920 --> 26:46.980
About your matter,

754
26:47.000 --> 26:48.720
the main problem is the lack of evidence.

755
26:48.720 --> 26:49.840
Come on, hurry up.

756
26:49.920 --> 26:50.960
Nonsense. If I had evidence,

757
26:50.960 --> 26:52.240
would I need your advice?

758
26:52.240 --> 26:53.240
Stop talking nonsense.

759
26:53.240 --> 26:54.720
Just tell me what to do.

760
26:54.800 --> 26:56.480
I've already thought of an idea for you.

761
26:56.480 --> 26:57.560
You go to Jia Xin,

762
26:57.560 --> 26:58.560
be his lackey,

763
26:58.640 --> 27:00.800
and find a chance to get the evidence.

764
27:01.080 --> 27:01.940
Are you kidding

765
27:02.800 --> 27:03.800
me?

766
27:04.080 --> 27:05.040
Jia Xin,

767
27:05.320 --> 27:07.080
a man whose character, IQ, and looks

768
27:07.080 --> 27:08.480
are far inferior to mine.

769
27:08.560 --> 27:09.800
Me, be his lackey?

770
27:10.120 --> 27:12.380
I might as well perish together with him.

771
27:12.560 --> 27:13.360
Anyway,

772
27:14.040 --> 27:15.480
I've given you an idea.

773
27:15.520 --> 27:16.760
In my experience,

774
27:17.000 --> 27:18.200
for all cases,

775
27:18.200 --> 27:19.720
the hardest step is gathering evidence.

776
27:19.720 --> 27:21.000
Whether to take this step

777
27:21.000 --> 27:21.920
is entirely up to you.

778
27:21.920 --> 27:22.720
Nonsense.

779
27:22.720 --> 27:24.240
Don't I know gathering evidence is hard?

780
27:24.240 --> 27:25.720
I think you're just tricking me into helping for nothing.

781
27:25.720 --> 27:26.480
Officer,

782
27:26.480 --> 27:27.400
someone ran away.

783
27:27.400 --> 27:29.200
Have you practiced sprinting?

784
27:29.240 --> 27:30.000
Don't run.

785
27:30.080 --> 27:31.160
Why run?

786
27:31.160 --> 27:32.000
Stop looking. Go.

787
27:32.000 --> 27:33.730
Severity for those who resist.

788
27:35.040 --> 27:36.040
Stop right there.

789
27:36.320 --> 27:36.800
Stop.

790
27:37.800 --> 27:39.280
Why are you everywhere?

791
27:42.440 --> 27:43.080
Don't run.

792
27:46.080 --> 27:47.520
You little crazy woman.

793
27:47.760 --> 27:49.040
You old scumbag.

794
27:51.520 --> 27:52.520
You want to run?

795
27:52.720 --> 27:54.780
Who do you think you are messing with?

796
27:56.240 --> 27:56.880
Let go.

797
27:58.240 --> 27:58.720
Behave.

798
27:59.400 --> 28:00.060
Don't move.

799
28:00.440 --> 28:00.960
Behave.

800
28:04.600 --> 28:05.440
These are the ID cards and household registers

801
28:05.440 --> 28:06.600
confiscated by Wu Guofu.

802
28:06.600 --> 28:07.930
Please sign to confirm.

803
28:08.040 --> 28:09.280
Thank you, officer.

804
28:09.760 --> 28:10.280
Wu Lian.

805
28:10.640 --> 28:11.680
You ungrateful wretch.

806
28:11.680 --> 28:13.080
You... you're not human.

807
28:13.360 --> 28:15.090
You little brat, just you wait.

808
28:15.280 --> 28:16.720
You even harmed your own father.

809
28:16.720 --> 28:19.320
You'll be struck by lightning sooner or later.

810
28:20.480 --> 28:22.240
I gave you food and drink.

811
28:22.360 --> 28:23.840
I raised you for nothing.

812
28:23.920 --> 28:25.320
You heartless beast.

813
28:25.760 --> 28:26.320
Let's go.

814
28:38.160 --> 28:38.960
It's okay now.

815
28:40.440 --> 28:40.960
It's okay.

816
28:40.960 --> 28:43.160
Wu Guofu has repeatedly participated in gambling, which is a serious offense.

817
28:43.160 --> 28:45.840
He will be placed under administrative detention for 15 days.

818
28:45.840 --> 28:46.970
Thank you, officer.

819
28:48.640 --> 28:49.720
Sister Long, look.

820
28:50.360 --> 28:51.160
My son is here.

821
28:53.200 --> 28:53.920
My son,

822
28:53.960 --> 28:54.690
a top lawyer.

823
28:55.560 --> 28:56.360
Hello, hello.

824
28:56.360 --> 28:57.200
Tell your dad

825
28:57.280 --> 28:59.410
not to hang around the casino anymore.

826
29:00.440 --> 29:01.560
I'll take him home right now.

827
29:01.560 --> 29:02.440
Sorry, sorry.

828
29:03.040 --> 29:03.800
Son, do you have a business card?

829
29:03.800 --> 29:04.530
Give him one.

830
29:04.680 --> 29:05.810
It'll come in handy.

831
29:17.080 --> 29:17.720
Not bad.

832
29:18.000 --> 29:18.960
Jun,

833
29:19.360 --> 29:20.440
when did you have a son?

834
29:20.440 --> 29:21.700
How come I didn't know?

835
29:21.760 --> 29:22.760
He's my godson.

836
29:23.040 --> 29:23.880
What's wrong?

837
29:27.000 --> 29:28.440
Come on, stop winking.

838
29:28.440 --> 29:29.480
I saw everything.

839
29:29.480 --> 29:30.240
Enough.

840
29:30.920 --> 29:32.360
My godfather was afraid you'd worry.

841
29:32.360 --> 29:32.880
You should go back.

842
29:32.880 --> 29:33.800
Get some rest early.

843
29:33.800 --> 29:34.960
You're too tired.

844
29:34.960 --> 29:35.280
Go, go, go.

845
29:35.280 --> 29:36.280
Stay right there.

846
29:37.040 --> 29:38.280
Where are you going?

847
29:39.080 --> 29:40.520
If I leave, the bike will...

848
29:40.520 --> 29:41.520
Someone will give me a ride.

849
29:41.520 --> 29:42.280
Shut up. Don't...

850
29:42.280 --> 29:42.800
Catch.

851
29:44.160 --> 29:45.000
Li Xin,

852
29:45.160 --> 29:46.090
I'm warning you,

853
29:46.400 --> 29:48.560
stay out of my family's business from now on.

854
29:48.560 --> 29:50.490
Let's stay out of each other's way.

855
29:51.040 --> 29:52.040
Then your warning is useless.

856
29:52.040 --> 29:53.320
We have our own relationships.

857
29:53.320 --> 29:54.040
You are you,

858
29:54.280 --> 29:55.280
and my godfather is my godfather.

859
29:55.280 --> 29:57.280
Call whoever you want your father.

860
29:57.280 --> 29:58.680
Okay, I'll take the helmet back for you.

861
29:58.680 --> 29:59.760
Get on.

862
30:02.480 --> 30:03.720
Get on, then.

863
30:03.800 --> 30:04.520
I'm not going back with you.

864
30:04.520 --> 30:05.200
Go by yourself.

865
30:05.200 --> 30:06.260
I have my ride here.

866
30:10.000 --> 30:11.320
Paddle with your feet.

867
30:11.680 --> 30:14.040
Are you just going to use your feet without starting the engine?

868
30:14.040 --> 30:15.520
I'll start it when we get on the road.

869
30:15.520 --> 30:16.520
You're so heavy.

870
30:17.760 --> 30:19.960
Can it move if you don't give it some gas?

871
30:24.800 --> 30:25.520
Alright.

872
30:26.680 --> 30:28.280
We've already gone a mile.

873
30:28.960 --> 30:30.200
Tell me the truth.

874
30:30.880 --> 30:32.520
Are you trying to be a bouncer?

875
30:32.520 --> 30:33.980
Going back to your old job?

876
30:38.960 --> 30:39.480
What

877
30:40.480 --> 30:41.520
are you doing?

878
30:41.520 --> 30:43.380
You almost knocked my brains out.

879
30:43.400 --> 30:44.160
If you went,

880
30:44.360 --> 30:46.120
you'd be an accomplice to running a casino.

881
30:46.120 --> 30:47.240
You'd go to jail.

882
30:47.240 --> 30:48.600
It was just a thought.

883
30:48.600 --> 30:49.840
I didn't act on it.

884
30:49.840 --> 30:51.200
That's the preparation stage of a crime.

885
30:51.200 --> 30:53.640
If I don't say anything, who knows I'm preparing?

886
30:53.640 --> 30:54.680
Xiaolong, let's not talk about that.

887
30:54.680 --> 30:55.680
Today, I

888
30:55.880 --> 30:56.920
handed out your law firm's cards

889
30:56.920 --> 30:58.240
to all my classmates at Beichuan University.

890
30:58.240 --> 30:59.480
I gave one to everyone.

891
30:59.480 --> 31:00.840
See how much I support your work?

892
31:00.840 --> 31:02.160
You really know how to cause trouble.

893
31:02.160 --> 31:04.240
Just say Beichuan Prison.

894
31:04.240 --> 31:05.200
Just call them inmates.

895
31:05.200 --> 31:06.000
Classmates?

896
31:06.000 --> 31:07.000
Old Xiao,

897
31:07.120 --> 31:08.560
look at your health.

898
31:08.640 --> 31:09.720
If you go in for a few more years,

899
31:09.720 --> 31:11.240
will you come out alive?

900
31:11.240 --> 31:12.240
What's wrong with my health?

901
31:12.240 --> 31:13.560
I'm fit for battle.

902
31:15.480 --> 31:16.010
Xiao Jun,

903
31:16.480 --> 31:17.440
do you not realize

904
31:17.440 --> 31:19.040
the severity of the problem?

905
31:20.840 --> 31:21.880
Alright, just drive.

906
31:21.880 --> 31:23.000
Drive, let's go home.

907
31:23.000 --> 31:23.720
Take me back.

908
31:23.720 --> 31:25.000
Go where? Get out.

909
31:26.480 --> 31:27.540
What are you doing?

910
31:27.640 --> 31:29.160
Aren't you fit for battle?

911
31:29.320 --> 31:30.400
Go march back.

912
31:31.120 --> 31:31.780
How can I...

913
31:33.480 --> 31:35.160
You have to drop me off.

914
31:35.800 --> 31:37.800
Is this how you treat the elderly?

915
31:38.560 --> 31:40.280
Where did you leave me?

916
31:42.080 --> 31:43.210
Where is this place?

917
31:43.560 --> 31:45.040
Where are you now?

918
31:53.320 --> 31:54.080
Come here.

919
31:54.280 --> 31:54.840
Everyone,

920
31:54.840 --> 31:55.800
come eat some apples.

921
31:55.800 --> 31:56.560
Thank you, Sister Lian.

922
31:56.560 --> 31:57.680
The lawyer lady gave them to us.

923
31:57.680 --> 31:59.000
Hello, everyone.

924
31:59.840 --> 32:00.570
Sister Lian,

925
32:00.680 --> 32:03.080
do you have the restaurant owner's WeChat?

926
32:03.800 --> 32:04.760
Miss Lawyer,

927
32:04.840 --> 32:05.560
she won't be able to

928
32:05.560 --> 32:06.800
get this money back.

929
32:06.800 --> 32:07.560
You see,

930
32:07.560 --> 32:08.840
we've seen this a lot.

931
32:09.040 --> 32:11.040
The boss had it all figured out.

932
32:11.320 --> 32:11.840
Yes.

933
32:12.080 --> 32:13.320
When I used to sweep the streets,

934
32:13.320 --> 32:14.480
if I sat down for a minute,

935
32:14.480 --> 32:15.960
they would deduct my pay.

936
32:16.320 --> 32:17.080
Then do this.

937
32:17.480 --> 32:19.010
Send a message to your boss.

938
32:19.040 --> 32:20.560
Say you've asked an expert.

939
32:20.560 --> 32:21.800
You'll go to the Human Resources Bureau,

940
32:21.800 --> 32:22.280
the Fire Department,

941
32:22.280 --> 32:23.960
and the Market Regulation Bureau to report him.

942
32:23.960 --> 32:25.040
Make him pay a fine.

943
32:25.720 --> 32:26.480
Report to what?

944
32:26.480 --> 32:27.520
What bureau was it?

945
32:27.520 --> 32:28.520
I can't remember.

946
32:29.040 --> 32:29.480
Let me do it.

947
32:29.480 --> 32:30.480
I remember it all.

948
32:31.440 --> 32:32.500
You're so helpful.

949
32:32.560 --> 32:33.840
Call the fire department.

950
32:33.840 --> 32:35.520
Is there anything you want to call him?

951
32:35.520 --> 32:36.760
Just curse at him.

952
32:36.760 --> 32:37.280
Curse.

953
32:37.280 --> 32:38.280
Curse at him hard.

954
32:38.520 --> 32:38.920
Curse.

955
32:41.080 --> 32:42.400
Cursing is easy.

956
32:42.400 --> 32:43.040
Exactly.

957
32:43.040 --> 32:43.700
Let me do it.

958
32:43.760 --> 32:45.040
You bastard, son of a bitch,

959
32:45.040 --> 32:46.040
scumbag boss.

960
32:46.160 --> 32:48.520
Bullying us workers just because you have some money.

961
32:48.520 --> 32:49.520
May lightning strike you.

962
32:49.520 --> 32:50.200
Owing people wages,

963
32:50.200 --> 32:51.040
he will die a horrible death.

964
32:51.040 --> 32:52.280
Death by a thousand cuts. Type it in.

965
32:52.280 --> 32:53.280
May his son be born without an asshole.

966
32:53.280 --> 32:53.560
Right.

967
32:53.560 --> 32:54.200
Sister, sister, sister.

968
32:54.200 --> 32:55.280
No, you can't use such foul language.

969
32:55.280 --> 32:55.760
Be civilized.

970
32:55.760 --> 32:56.760
Let's tone it down a bit.

971
32:56.760 --> 32:57.560
Be civilized.

972
32:57.640 --> 32:58.900
Then I know what to say.

973
32:59.040 --> 33:00.320
My sister is inspired. You do it.

974
33:00.320 --> 33:01.380
You do it. You type.

975
33:01.520 --> 33:02.640
Then may he

976
33:02.640 --> 33:04.280
choke to death on a big meat bun.

977
33:04.280 --> 33:05.960
Why would you even give him a meat bun?

978
33:05.960 --> 33:07.600
Let him eat stinky tofu and stink to death.

979
33:07.600 --> 33:09.760
We shouldn't even give him stinky tofu.

980
33:09.760 --> 33:10.520
I work all day,

981
33:10.520 --> 33:11.320
and I can't even bear to buy stinky tofu.

982
33:11.320 --> 33:12.080
Let me tell you,

983
33:12.080 --> 33:13.760
the stinky tofu at our night market is so good.

984
33:13.760 --> 33:14.760
People line up to buy it.

985
33:14.760 --> 33:16.120
Let's go eat it together someday.

986
33:16.120 --> 33:17.720
Still thinking about stinky tofu, you really...

987
33:17.720 --> 33:18.800
I really love eating stinky tofu.

988
33:18.800 --> 33:20.000
The more you eat, the better it tastes.

989
33:20.000 --> 33:22.120
I'll treat everyone when I get paid.

990
33:23.880 --> 33:26.340
The boss replied, 'How dare you curse at me?'

991
33:28.600 --> 33:29.240
Well,

992
33:29.240 --> 33:30.520
she cursed at me first.

993
33:32.000 --> 33:33.040
I remember now.

994
33:33.400 --> 33:34.560
You're the woman who came to my shop

995
33:34.560 --> 33:35.760
asking about Wu Lian.

996
33:35.760 --> 33:36.680
You're so sneaky.

997
33:36.680 --> 33:37.340
Defendant,

998
33:37.520 --> 33:38.640
please observe court discipline.

999
33:38.640 --> 33:39.640
Besides the text messages,

1000
33:39.640 --> 33:41.680
I also have a set of photo evidence

1001
33:41.680 --> 33:43.640
taken from a review app.

1002
33:43.680 --> 33:44.800
In the past six months,

1003
33:44.800 --> 33:47.080
there were 108 reviews

1004
33:47.080 --> 33:48.440
with photos on the app.

1005
33:48.440 --> 33:48.920
Among them,

1006
33:48.920 --> 33:50.360
16 photos

1007
33:50.360 --> 33:51.800
showed my client

1008
33:51.800 --> 33:53.120
cleaning the tables.

1009
33:53.360 --> 33:56.200
These photos were uploaded spontaneously by diners,

1010
33:56.200 --> 33:59.120
so there is no possibility of forgery or bribery.

1011
33:59.360 --> 34:00.360
My client

1012
34:00.440 --> 34:02.170
works hard without complaint.

1013
34:03.400 --> 34:04.460
These hands of hers

1014
34:04.640 --> 34:06.160
are the proof of her hard work.

1015
34:06.160 --> 34:07.680
Proof of self-reliance.

1016
34:09.520 --> 34:12.520
There are many women like Wu Lian.

1017
34:13.199 --> 34:15.520
Limited by their upbringing,

1018
34:15.960 --> 34:17.420
they have no one to rely on.

1019
34:17.440 --> 34:18.440
They think

1020
34:18.560 --> 34:21.560
they can rely on their own hands to support themselves

1021
34:21.600 --> 34:23.960
and live a stable and peaceful life.

1022
34:24.960 --> 34:26.620
But the reality is often that,

1023
34:27.040 --> 34:29.480
due to their ignorance of the law,

1024
34:29.760 --> 34:30.960
they are often used

1025
34:31.480 --> 34:32.480
and bullied.

1026
34:33.120 --> 34:35.179
Take my client, Wu Lian, for example.

1027
34:35.360 --> 34:36.159
Her father

1028
34:36.199 --> 34:37.600
would weave a trap for her

1029
34:37.600 --> 34:39.860
where the child pays the father's debts,

1030
34:39.920 --> 34:42.650
using family ties to emotionally blackmail her.

1031
34:42.679 --> 34:45.639
Her unscrupulous boss would take advantage of her vulnerability

1032
34:45.639 --> 34:47.920
to ruthlessly exploit her labor.

1033
34:48.440 --> 34:49.639
At times like this,

1034
34:50.440 --> 34:52.400
no one tells her what to do.

1035
34:52.800 --> 34:54.199
She can only endure it.

1036
34:55.400 --> 34:56.440
But is that right?

1037
34:58.160 --> 34:59.400
I want to tell them

1038
35:01.200 --> 35:02.000
that the law

1039
35:03.480 --> 35:05.240
can be their support.

1040
35:05.560 --> 35:06.720
Plaintiff's counsel.

1041
35:06.720 --> 35:07.760
Let's try to

1042
35:07.760 --> 35:09.600
limit the speaking time during the trial.

1043
35:09.600 --> 35:11.200
Sorry, I couldn't hold back.

1044
35:11.240 --> 35:14.160
According to the Labor Contract Law of the People's Republic of China,

1045
35:14.160 --> 35:16.000
According to Article 82,

1046
35:16.000 --> 35:19.040
if no labor contract is signed,

1047
35:19.160 --> 35:21.680
the employer must pay double wages

1048
35:21.840 --> 35:23.360
starting from the second month.

1049
35:23.360 --> 35:25.200
Therefore, we request

1050
35:25.320 --> 35:28.720
that the defendant pay 8,000 yuan according to this law,

1051
35:28.880 --> 35:31.120
plus 10,000 yuan for five months of unpaid wages,

1052
35:31.120 --> 35:33.360
and compensation for illegal termination

1053
35:33.360 --> 35:34.200
of 2,000 yuan,

1054
35:34.320 --> 35:34.880
totaling

1055
35:35.080 --> 35:36.080
20,000 yuan.

1056
35:45.840 --> 35:46.240
Here.

1057
35:46.920 --> 35:48.320
This one is a bit different

1058
35:48.320 --> 35:49.120
from your previous one.

1059
35:49.120 --> 35:51.320
Keep it as a souvenir.

1060
35:53.840 --> 35:55.480
Sister, you must keep your ID card and bank card

1061
35:55.480 --> 35:56.720
safe.

1062
35:56.720 --> 35:57.440
They are right here.

1063
35:57.440 --> 35:58.960
Make sure to call me when you arrive,

1064
35:58.960 --> 36:00.040
so I can rest assured.

1065
36:00.040 --> 36:02.160
Make sure you have everything. Don't lose anything.

1066
36:02.160 --> 36:02.920
I'm leaving.

1067
36:03.040 --> 36:03.840
Go ahead.

1068
36:03.840 --> 36:04.680
Don't miss your train.

1069
36:04.680 --> 36:05.160
Okay.

1070
36:05.440 --> 36:06.160
Go back.

1071
36:07.520 --> 36:08.160
Goodbye.

1072
36:10.880 --> 36:16.440
I also want to go to a place far, far away.

1073
36:17.400 --> 36:18.130
I will save up

1074
36:18.560 --> 36:21.000
all the money I earn from working

1075
36:21.480 --> 36:23.200
and rent a small house.

1076
36:24.120 --> 36:26.000
I will have hot water for showers

1077
36:26.360 --> 36:27.840
and apples to eat.

1078
36:29.120 --> 36:29.920
That's great.

1079
36:30.160 --> 36:33.160
Sister Lian can finally go to the place she wants to go.

1080
36:33.640 --> 36:34.440
So, Sister,

1081
36:34.600 --> 36:36.440
where exactly is that far, far away place

1082
36:36.440 --> 36:37.560
Sister Lian mentioned?

1083
36:37.560 --> 36:38.480
Train T33 from Leyang Station

1084
36:38.480 --> 36:41.480
to Tieling

1085
36:41.480 --> 36:43.140
has started ticket checking.

1086
36:43.320 --> 36:45.760
Passengers taking Train T33,

1087
36:45.760 --> 36:47.920
please go to Ticket Gate 6. Tieling?

1088
36:49.440 --> 36:50.600
That's a big city.

1089
36:50.640 --> 36:51.840
Indeed.

1090
36:52.600 --> 36:54.560
Let's go. Let's go back to our big law firm.

1091
36:54.560 --> 36:55.520
Let's go.

1092
36:56.160 --> 36:56.680
Sister,

1093
36:56.760 --> 36:57.760
I feel we are much freer now

1094
36:57.760 --> 36:59.480
than when we were in Honghu.

1095
36:59.720 --> 37:01.120
Are you telling the truth?

1096
37:01.120 --> 37:01.880
Of course.

1097
37:04.240 --> 37:07.170
Thanks to Lawyer Li for the farmers' issue this time.

1098
37:07.360 --> 37:08.160
It's my duty.

1099
37:08.520 --> 37:09.680
This way of handling it

1100
37:09.680 --> 37:10.800
is very professional.

1101
37:10.800 --> 37:11.660
You flatter me.

1102
37:11.800 --> 37:13.600
Your apprentice is really good.

1103
37:13.720 --> 37:15.840
He has a bright future ahead.

1104
37:16.320 --> 37:18.440
I'll leave Wangang's legal affairs to you from now on.

1105
37:18.440 --> 37:19.360
Thank you, Mr. Wan.

1106
37:19.360 --> 37:19.960
Okay.

1107
37:20.080 --> 37:22.140
Here's to a successful partnership.

1108
37:22.480 --> 37:22.810
Okay.

1109
37:35.800 --> 37:36.400
Lawyer Li.

1110
37:42.560 --> 37:43.160
Lawyer Li.

1111
37:43.160 --> 37:44.640
My classmate said Xiao Longnü handed out business cards

1112
37:44.640 --> 37:45.640
at their company.

1113
37:45.760 --> 37:48.720
I heard she went through all that trouble just for a legal aid case.

1114
37:48.720 --> 37:51.450
She still loves playing the champion of justice.

1115
37:51.560 --> 37:52.560
You'll receive a notice

1116
37:52.560 --> 37:54.320
assigning a legal aid case in the next few days.

1117
37:54.320 --> 37:55.160
You handle it.

1118
37:56.880 --> 37:57.320
Okay.

1119
37:57.440 --> 37:58.360
I'll pass it on to

1120
37:58.360 --> 37:59.600
the first and second-year rookies later.

1121
37:59.600 --> 38:01.130
Let them get some practice.

1122
38:03.560 --> 38:04.640
I meant you.

1123
38:05.160 --> 38:06.760
You need more practice too.

1124
38:18.200 --> 38:19.400
You don't even drink.

1125
38:19.600 --> 38:21.600
Are you just here for the vibe?

1126
38:22.800 --> 38:24.330
You took the farmers' case.

1127
38:24.640 --> 38:26.280
You're well-informed.

1128
38:27.120 --> 38:29.120
Wangang has gone too far.

1129
38:29.400 --> 38:30.800
They polluted the whole farm.

1130
38:30.800 --> 38:33.000
Not a single live shrimp or fish is left.

1131
38:33.000 --> 38:34.880
But there's no evidence right now

1132
38:34.920 --> 38:37.250
that the pollution is related to Wangang.

1133
38:39.120 --> 38:40.580
Did Wangang approach you?

1134
38:41.480 --> 38:42.340
They came to me.

1135
38:43.080 --> 38:44.740
But I've also met that farmer.

1136
38:45.000 --> 38:47.200
I think it's risky if you represent him.

1137
38:47.600 --> 38:49.040
But if we represent Wangang together,

1138
38:49.040 --> 38:50.840
we can both be promoted to senior partners this year.

1139
38:50.840 --> 38:52.120
I think it's a good opportunity.

1140
38:52.120 --> 38:53.920
I have no interest in such an opportunity.

1141
38:53.920 --> 38:55.280
I advise you not to get any ideas either.

1142
38:55.280 --> 38:56.640
According to industry rules,

1143
38:56.640 --> 38:58.680
we can't represent both the plaintiff and the defendant at the same time.

1144
38:58.680 --> 38:59.880
If you want to take it,

1145
39:00.200 --> 39:02.000
you should resign voluntarily.

1146
39:02.280 --> 39:03.160
I gotta go.

1147
39:12.080 --> 39:12.720
I am Li Xin.

1148
39:14.200 --> 39:16.640
We at Wangang will fully cooperate with you.

1149
39:16.640 --> 39:17.240
Director,

1150
39:17.280 --> 39:18.880
I have something to tell you.

1151
39:22.440 --> 39:23.120
Master.

1152
39:23.560 --> 39:25.760
I took over Mr. Pan's case first.

1153
39:26.040 --> 39:27.440
He exploited a loophole in the process

1154
39:27.440 --> 39:29.280
and got it approved before me.

1155
39:29.280 --> 39:29.920
I request

1156
39:30.320 --> 39:31.560
that his approval be withdrawn.

1157
39:31.560 --> 39:34.090
There's no company rule against expediting.

1158
39:34.440 --> 39:36.760
Have the farmers paid their legal fees?

1159
39:37.440 --> 39:39.240
I took it on a contingency basis.

1160
39:41.360 --> 39:42.360
Whose risk?

1161
39:48.320 --> 39:48.960
Director.

1162
39:50.720 --> 39:52.450
I remember when I first joined,

1163
39:52.600 --> 39:53.880
you taught us

1164
39:55.160 --> 39:56.360
that a lawyer's sword

1165
39:56.600 --> 39:58.680
should be wielded for the defenseless.

1166
39:58.680 --> 40:01.080
Those farmers really have nowhere to turn.

1167
40:01.200 --> 40:02.160
Shouldn't we

1168
40:02.160 --> 40:03.560
stand with them?

1169
40:03.840 --> 40:04.640
Xiaolong.

1170
40:05.280 --> 40:07.410
Your understanding of law and justice

1171
40:07.480 --> 40:08.920
is too superficial.

1172
40:09.840 --> 40:12.120
I trained both of you myself.

1173
40:12.440 --> 40:13.760
At critical moments,

1174
40:14.200 --> 40:15.860
you need to take a longer view.

1175
40:16.200 --> 40:17.530
This matter is settled.

1176
40:18.000 --> 40:19.200
Go back and calm down.

1177
40:19.800 --> 40:20.960
Think carefully

1178
40:21.400 --> 40:22.840
about what kind of lawyer

1179
40:23.080 --> 40:24.280
you really want to be.

1180
40:26.960 --> 40:28.160
It's settled, right?

1181
40:32.640 --> 40:33.370
Understood.

1182
40:35.560 --> 40:36.200
Director.

1183
40:37.800 --> 40:38.640
I resign.

1184
40:39.120 --> 40:39.760
Lao Pan.

1185
40:39.880 --> 40:42.680
The paperwork for my new law firm has come through.

1186
40:42.720 --> 40:43.720
I'm dropping

1187
40:45.160 --> 40:45.960
this lawsuit.

1188
40:46.480 --> 40:49.280
I've already agreed to their settlement terms.

1189
40:49.920 --> 40:51.080
Lawyer Li said

1190
40:51.080 --> 40:54.040
this kind of lawsuit could take years.

1191
40:54.040 --> 40:55.280
If we lose,

1192
40:55.280 --> 40:57.600
we won't get a single penny.

1193
40:57.800 --> 41:00.480
Now Wangang has agreed to give each household 300,000

1194
41:00.480 --> 41:03.200
to buy our dead fish and shrimp.

1195
41:03.200 --> 41:04.530
Although it's not much,

1196
41:04.800 --> 41:07.880
we all owe bank loans.

1197
41:07.880 --> 41:11.240
We really can't hold on anymore.

1198
41:11.720 --> 41:13.840
Attorney Xiao, I'm sorry.

1199
41:23.160 --> 41:24.640
The problem has been solved.

1200
41:24.640 --> 41:25.970
Let's go back to Honghu.

1201
41:26.120 --> 41:27.980
Did you really solve the problem?

1202
41:28.600 --> 41:31.080
You just got rid of the people who raised it.

1203
41:31.720 --> 41:33.520
Addressing demands in the shortest time,

1204
41:33.520 --> 41:35.000
resolving conflicts at the lowest cost,

1205
41:35.000 --> 41:36.480
and saving social resources.

1206
41:36.480 --> 41:37.410
Isn't that good?

1207
41:37.680 --> 41:38.880
What about the facts?

1208
41:38.920 --> 41:40.120
What about the truth?

1209
41:40.960 --> 41:43.200
Did Wangang admit to what they did?

1210
41:43.560 --> 41:45.890
Will the pollution issue just be ignored?

1211
41:46.680 --> 41:47.640
You just blindly

1212
41:47.640 --> 41:49.280
use money to shut them up.

1213
41:50.560 --> 41:51.200
Li Xin.

1214
41:51.960 --> 41:53.520
Do you think this is fair?

1215
41:54.480 --> 41:56.480
I understand the fairness you want,

1216
41:56.680 --> 41:58.320
but you can't ignore the cost,

1217
41:58.320 --> 42:00.250
let alone gamble with your future.

1218
42:01.200 --> 42:01.800
Xiaolong,

1219
42:03.120 --> 42:04.000
we are friends.

1220
42:05.200 --> 42:07.730
I sincerely hope you think it over carefully.

1221
42:10.360 --> 42:12.090
I am officially informing you,

1222
42:14.360 --> 42:15.680
from now on,

1223
42:18.280 --> 42:19.680
we are no longer friends.

1224
42:43.640 --> 42:45.520
100 minus.
